Exception: gmuETD.sty

The file gmuETD.sty is the George Mason University thesis and dissertation
style, written by Daniel O. Awduche and Christopher A. St. Jean with later
modifications by Muhammad Abdulla and Tammy Stitz, and distributed by
University Dissertation and Thesis Services (UDTS) at
https://udts.gmu.edu/. It is included here unchanged, with its own notices,
and is not covered by the license above. Its copyright remains with its
authors and George Mason University. Permission from UDTS to redistribute it
in this project has been requested and not yet given. The example figure
figures/figGeorgeMason.pdf comes from the same UDTS template.
